{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/decisiondiagrams\/zerosuppresseddecisiondiagram"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram.swift#L27","fileName":"ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"DecisionDiagrams"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram"}],"externalID":"s:16DecisionDiagrams014ZeroSuppressedA7DiagramV","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram","roleHeading":"Structure"},"abstract":[{"text":"A shared table of zero-suppressed decision diagrams: families of sets drawn from the elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"0 ..< elementCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", each a directed acyclic graph whose vertices test one element and branch","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a low child (the sets without it) and a high child (the sets with it, the element removed),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"down to the constants: the empty family and the family holding only the empty set (Minato,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“Zero-Suppressed BDDs for Set Manipulation in Combinatorial Problems”, 1993).","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Elements are tested in index order, 0 nearest the root. The table never holds two vertices","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that test the same element with the same children, nor a vertex whose high child is the empty","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"family, so each family has one vertex: two ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/Family","isActive":true},{"text":" values are equal exactly when they hold","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same sets. An element no set of a family contains never appears in its diagram, which keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the diagrams of sparse families small.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var diagram = ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram(elementCount: 3)","let f = diagram.family([[0, 1], [1, 2], [2]])","diagram.count(of: f)                                  \/\/ 3","let g = diagram.including(2, in: f)                   \/\/ {{1, 2}, {2}}","diagram.minimalSets(of: g) == diagram.family([[2]])   \/\/ true","diagram.join(diagram.single(0), g)                    \/\/ {{0, 1, 2}, {0, 2}}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Families are built by the mutating methods, which add vertices to the table and leave every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"existing family as it was; a family belongs to the table it was built in and its copies. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"table keeps every vertex it has made until "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/collectGarbage(keeping:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" drops the ones no kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"family reaches."}]}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/Family","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/GraphView-swift.struct","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/SetsView"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/init(elementCount:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/elementCount","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/empty","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/graphView-swift.property","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/tableVertexCount","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/unit"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/collectGarbage(keeping:)","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/contains(_:in:)","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/count(of:)","doc:\/\/De